   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x201c;Sustainable Smallholder Irrigated Agriculture in Arid and Semi-Arid Lands in Maekel, Anseba and Gash-Barka Regions, Eritrea&#x201d; promotes climate-resilient and sustainable agricultural development. It integrates the principles of agroecology by addressing ecological, social, and economic dimensions of sustainability.</narrative>
